{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Poly Plaza ULTIMATE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong>\u00a0<strong>ULTIMATE</strong> is an enhanced, more complete version of <strong>Poly Plaza,</strong>\u00a0an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect rent, and become the richest man in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's new?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All DLC's from Poly Plaza are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clothing system has been completly re-worked to not use steam items anymore, instead all clothes can be purchased in-game trough a new shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is now more alive with NPC's walking arround, cars parked in the streets and cars driving arround.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game have a lot of more content, including new quests, new vehicles, new craft recipes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208170?t=1754486441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208170?t=1754486441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208170/5ab924eb1a3e243b3f4b62175348e9e9e1497b9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754486441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208170/5ab924eb1a3e243b3f4b62175348e9e9e1497b9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754486441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Poly Plaza ULTIMATE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong>\u00a0<strong>ULTIMATE</strong> is an enhanced, more complete version of <strong>Poly Plaza,</strong>\u00a0an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect 